---
// No props — purely visual, no contextual data on the home page.
---

<!--
  Header plate: the current leaves the title block and runs onto the sheet.

  The mass sits on the left, under the type: two rails run parallel beneath
  the name and the role, then the lower one turns up and joins the bus where
  the subtitle ends (x=360). From there a single trace crosses the sheet,
  hops once, and runs off the right edge.

  One motif used once — the r=20 semicircle the footer answers at its centre.
  The three evenly-spaced arcs this replaced read as a frieze, not a drawing:
  a schematic earns its interest from difference, and its density from what
  the page actually puts above it. Don't re-space anything here into a
  period.

  The bus is one path on purpose, arc included: la machine respire's walking
  signal traverses whatever path it picks, so the current crosses the whole
  plate and takes the bridge. Split it into segments and the signal only ever
  gets a piece.

  y=20  ─|────────────────────────●(360)──────────╭───╮(520→560)──|─────|────
         tick(20)                 merge          hop apex(540)   tick  tick
  y=40  ─|────────────────────────╯                    (620)     (720)
         tick(20)
--><!--
  Mobile: the full circuit collapses to mush under ~400px, so it reduces to
  its smallest legible unit — the same sentence in one stroke. A rail starts
  at the left datum, turns up, and runs out to a pad.

  y=3              ╭─────────────────────●
  y=11  |──────────╯                  dot(122)
        tick(1)   merge(52)
-->
<div class="mt-4 md:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
    width="132"
    height="15"
    viewBox="0 0 132 15"
    fill="none"
    class="decoration"
  >
    <path
      d="M 1 8 L 1 14"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="0.75"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>
    <path
      d="M 1 11 L 40 11 Q 52 11 52 3 L 118 3"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>
    <circle cx="122" cy="3" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>
  </svg>
</div>

<div class="mt-5 hidden overflow-visible md:block" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg
    width="100%"
    viewBox="0 -4 760 54"
    fill="none"
    class="decoration"
    style="overflow: visible"
  >
    <!-- The bus: full width, with the single hop at x=460→500 (apex 480,0).
         One path, so the walking signal can cross the plate and arc over. -->
    <path
      d="M 0 20 L 520 20 A 20 20 0 0 1 560 20 L 760 20"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>

    <!-- The title block's second rail: runs under the type, then turns up and
         joins the bus where the subtitle ends. Also one path — the current
         visibly takes the corner. -->
    <path
      d="M 0 40 L 340 40 Q 360 40 360 20"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>

    <!-- Left datum: both rails registered at x=20 -->
    <path
      d="M 20 16 L 20 24"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="0.75"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>
    <path
      d="M 20 36 L 20 44"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="0.75"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>

    <!-- Trailing ticks, deliberately unevenly spaced (60 / 100 / 40) -->
    <path
      d="M 620 16 L 620 24"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="0.75"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>
    <path
      d="M 720 16 L 720 24"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="0.75"
      class="circuit-trace"></path>

    <!-- Merge junction -->
    <circle cx="360" cy="20" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>

    <!-- Hop: feet and apex -->
    <circle cx="520" cy="20" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>
    <circle cx="560" cy="20" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>
    <circle cx="540" cy="0" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>

    <!-- Datum dots -->
    <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>
    <circle cx="20" cy="40" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" class="circuit-dot"
    ></circle>

    <!-- La machine respire's walking signal visits this plate too, but it is
         the generic instrument in src/scripts/respire.ts — no hand-authored
         SMIL here, or home would carry two currents. -->
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .decoration {
    color: var(--ink-circuit);
  }

  .circuit-dot {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .circuit-dot {
      opacity: 1 !important;
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
